				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.36
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τίνα μέσον τάξω λόγον</span>;
				<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>El.</u>
				908
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρῶτον καὶ τελευταῖον τὸ
